<title>UK: ICI firm, Merrill Lynch rates technical buy.</title>
<headline>ICI firm, Merrill Lynch rates technical buy.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1996-10-02</dateline>
<text>
<p>Shares in UK chemicals group ICI Plc were sharply higher on Wednesday, lifted by a recommendation from brokerage Merrill Lynch, traders said.</p>
<p>Market sources said Merrill Lynch on Wednesday recommended ICI as a &quot;technical buy.&quot; The shares touched 889p but slipped back to trade at 874-1/2p by 1129 GMT, up 16p on the day.</p>
<p>The sources said Merrill Lynch also recommended textiles group Courtaulds Plc and industrial gases group BOC Plc as technical buys. Courtaulds was up five pence at 483-1/2p but BOC traded one penny lower at 874p.</p>
<p>-- London Newsroom +44 171 542 4367</p>
</text>
